### ── ADMIN ROUTES ───────────────────────────────

### 1. View all users
GET http://localhost:6435/admin-api/users
Content-Type: application/json


###

### 2. Block a user (replace USER_ID with actual MongoDB _id)
PATCH http://localhost:6435/admin-api/users/69faeac33c7351861a94b13a/block
Content-Type: application/json


###

### 3. Block yourself (should return 400 — cannot block yourself)
PATCH http://localhost:6435/admin-api/users/69faedacd45530b84f0b2945/block
Content-Type: application/json


###

### 4. Block another admin (should return 400 — cannot block admin)
PATCH http://localhost:6435/admin-api/users/69faeebad45530b84f0b2946/block
Content-Type: application/json


###

### 5. Block already blocked user (should return 400 — already blocked)
PATCH http://localhost:6435/admin-api/users/69faeac33c7351861a94b13a/block
Content-Type: application/json


###

### 6. Unblock a user
PATCH http://localhost:6435/admin-api/users/69faeac33c7351861a94b13a/unblock
Content-Type: application/json


###

### 7. Unblock already active user (should return 400 — already unblocked)
PATCH http://localhost:6435/admin-api/users/69faeac33c7351861a94b13a/unblock
Content-Type: application/json


###

### 8. Block non-existent user (should return 404)
PATCH http://localhost:6435/admin-api/users/000000000000000000000000/block
Content-Type: application/json


###


### ── POSTS ───────────────────────────────


### 9. View all posts (including soft-deleted ones)
GET http://localhost:6435/admin-api/posts
Content-Type: application/json


###

### 10. Hard delete a post permanently (replace POST_ID)
DELETE http://localhost:6435/admin-api/posts/POST_ID
Content-Type: application/json


###

### 11. Hard delete non-existent post (should return 404)
DELETE http://localhost:6435/admin-api/posts/000000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json


###


### ── STATS ───────────────────────────────


### 12. Get dashboard stats
GET http://localhost:6435/admin-api/stats
Content-Type: application/json


###


### ── AUTH FAILURE CASES ──────────────────


### 13. Access without token (should return 401)
### (Clear your cookies or use a different browser session)
GET http://localhost:6435/admin-api/users
Content-Type: application/json


###

### 14. Access with non-admin token (should return 403)
### (Login as a regular user first, then try this)
GET http://localhost:6435/admin-api/users
Content-Type: application/json


###
